<title>USA: Gallery of History Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Gallery of History Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gallery of History Inc.</p>
<p>				  Financial Highlights</p>
<p>					  First quarter ended Dec. 31,</p>
<p>						 1996		   1995</p>
<p> Revenues			    $  741,759	    $  635,622</p>
<p> Net income			  479,461(a)		  41,113</p>
<p> Earnings per share			 .14		     .01</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding     3,356,875	     5,917,654</p>
<p>(a) In October 1996, the company repurchased 2,659,720 shares of its common stock for total consideration of $2 million, consisting of 460 documents valued at $1,803,045 and $196,955 in cash.  The book value of the inventory was $1,446,492, resulting in a gain on disposition of $356,553 or 11 cents per share, which is included in the current quarter's net income.</p>
</text>
